<title>USA: Northwest Airlines Corp Q4 oper shr profit.</title>
<headline>Northwest Airlines Corp Q4 oper shr profit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			   1995</p>
<p> Oper shr primary profit $0.20     loss	 $0.10</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted profit $0.19     loss	 $0.09</p>
<p> Net profit		 26,000   profit	 3,600</p>
<p> Revs		    2,340,100		2,201,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	103,200		   96,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	114,200		  105,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 oper loss per share after $13.9 million in preferred stock requirements.  </p>
<p>1995 Q4 oper loss per share is also after $200,000 in preferred stock transactions.</p>
<p>1995 Q4 oper results exclude $49.9 million, or $0.51/shr primary and $0.47/shr diluted, net gain on extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>1995 Q4 net after all items was profit $0.41/shr primary and $0.38/shr diluted.</p>
